### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

###

### 用户注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe@2026"
}

### 用户名重复：预期 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user",
  "email": "demo2@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe@2026"
}

###

### 邮箱重复：预期 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user_2",
  "email": "demo@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe@2026"
}

###

### 登录成功
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "demo_user",
  "password": "ChangeMe@2026"
}

###

### 密码错误：预期 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "demo_user",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

###

### 获取当前用户：将 TOKEN 替换为登录响应中的 accessToken
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

###

### 未携带 Token：预期 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me


### 创建知识库
POST http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge-bases
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "机器学习论文",
  "description": "用于收集和整理机器学习方向论文"
}

### 获取知识库列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge-bases
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 获取知识库详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge-bases/1
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 更新知识库
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge-bases/1
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "深度学习论文",
  "description": "用于收集深度学习方向论文"
}

### 删除知识库
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/knowledge-bases/1
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN